 152:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/themes/default/../../../src/core/../misc/lv_style.h ****     /*The properties are listed in a special order to make caching more effective.
 153:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/themes/default/../../../src/core/../misc/lv_style.h ****      *Groups are used when LV_OBJ_STYLE_CACHE is enabled.
 154:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/themes/default/../../../src/core/../misc/lv_style.h ****      *If a property from a groups is set, a bit will be set in
 155:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/themes/default/../../../src/core/../misc/lv_style.h ****      *obj->style_main_prop_is_set and style_other_prop_is_set
 156:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/themes/default/../../../src/core/../misc/lv_style.h ****      *to indicate that the property is set.
 157:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/themes/default/../../../src/core/../misc/lv_style.h ****      *
 158:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/themes/default/../../../src/core/../misc/lv_style.h ****      *Strategy 1: group related properties. E.g. if no "border" properties are set
 159:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/themes/default/../../../src/core/../misc/lv_style.h ****      *            they will be skipped quickly.
 160:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/themes/default/../../../src/core/../misc/lv_style.h ****      *
 161:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/themes/default/../../../src/core/../misc/lv_style.h ****      *Strategy 2: group common property with rarely used properties. This way
 162:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/themes/default/../../../src/core/../misc/lv_style.h ****      *            the common property is cached properly and it's rarely affected
